<title>USA: ADR REPORT - British Airways up on NYSE.</title>
<headline>ADR REPORT - British Airways up on NYSE.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of British ADR British Airways Plc rallied 1-3/4 to 97-3/4 on Monday after Merrill Lynch named it as one of the nine UK stocks it expected to outperform through 1997.</p>
<p>There was also strength in some Japanese stocks traded on the New York Stock Exchange, with Kyocera Corp up three at 127-1/2, Hitachi Ltd up 7/8 at 93-7/8 and TDK Corp up 1-1/4 at 65.  </p>
<p>Shares of Telebrasilia SA were down 1-3/4 at 72-5/8.</p>
</text>
